  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "These sources are an About page and a fall office catering menu from Salvia Kitchen, run by Ana and her brother Tomas.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_22d10e004da4"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_22d10e004da4"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_75e08cd57ab8"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Last year they catered 214 events and served about 9,600 guests, mostly office lunches and baby showers.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_22d10e004da4"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Boxed lunches cost $16 per person with a 10-box minimum, and family-style trays cost $24 per person for at least 15 guests.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_75e08cd57ab8"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_75e08cd57ab8"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Orders need 72 hours notice, and delivery is free within 10 miles of downtown but costs $35 beyond that.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_75e08cd57ab8"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Every menu can be made gluten-free on request, and all eight major allergens are labeled.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_75e08cd57ab8"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "Salvia Kitchen served about 9,600 guests at 214 events last year. Trays only come in sizes for 15, 25 or 40 guests. How do they serve events larger than 40?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_22d10e004da4"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_75e08cd57ab8"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Trays cost $24 per person and boxed lunches cost $16, a gap of $8 per person. What do tray buyers get for that extra $8?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_75e08cd57ab8"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_75e08cd57ab8"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Baby showers are one of their two main kinds of business, but the fall menu is built for offices. What do baby shower clients order?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_22d10e004da4"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_75e08cd57ab8"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      }
    ],
